OL,4,CAfghan women heartbroken             W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GWhen Shahira Sadat received an       W5
OL,7,Ginvitation for a Chevening           W5
OL,8,GScholarship interview, she felt a    W5
OL,9,Grare glimmer of hope.                W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GThe software engineer in Kabul had   W5
OL,12,Gspent three years battling Taliban   W5
OL,13,Grestrictions, jumping through hoops  W5
OL,14,Gand working through power and        W5
OL,15,Ginternet outages to prepare her      W5
OL,16,Gapplications for UK universities and W5
OL,17,Ggrants.                              W5
OL,18,                                      W5
OL,19,G"I was so happy. I can't describe it W5
OL,20,Gbecause I allowed myself to dream    W5
OL,21,Gabout studying in the UK," she says. W5
